                  "blocks": {
                    "text_f3iedd": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Breakouts occur when pores become clogged with excess oil, bacteria, and debris. Hydrocolloid technology absorbs these impurities from inflamed pores and simultaneously protects the skin from external irritants. By maintaining a moist healing environment, the sheet supports the skin’s natural repair process, promoting calm, low-irritation healing.</p>",
